WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:13.536
Tala's parents are from the Philippines.

2
00:00:13.537 --> 00:00:17.529
They are Filipino.

3
00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:23.425
When I go to her house, we eat shaved ice.

4
00:00:23.426 --> 00:00:27.394
It is sweet and delicious.

5
00:00:27.395 --> 00:00:31.163
Carolina's parents are from Germany.

6
00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:34.219
They are German.

7
00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:39.484
When I play at her house, we eat sausage!

8
00:00:39.485 --> 00:00:44.663
It is salty and delicious.

9
00:00:44.664 --> 00:00:48.038
Uri's parents are from Israel.

10
00:00:48.039 --> 00:00:51.560
They are Israeli.

11
00:00:51.561 --> 00:00:57.023
When he comes over, he brings sesame snacks.

12
00:00:57.024 --> 00:01:01.414
They are crunchy and delicious!

13
00:01:01.415 --> 00:01:04.952
Elsa's parents are from Sweden.

14
00:01:04.953 --> 00:01:08.700
They are Swedish.

15
00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:13.921
When I go to her house, we eat rice pudding.

16
00:01:13.922 --> 00:01:18.990
It is creamy and delicious.

17
00:01:18.991 --> 00:01:25.220
Tala, Carolina, Uri, Elsa, and I are in the same class.

18
00:01:25.221 --> 00:01:28.854
We are all friends.
